WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080
The EU should be a body which thrives when countries work together when making key decisions.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.640
But one key question which must be asked is who should enforce these decisions made

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:17.560
by the EU and how should those who breach the agreements reached be brought to justice?

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.520
The Court of Justice of the EU, which operates out of Luxembourg.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:27.740
This court works to ensure that each country applies EU law in the intended manner, and

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.100
it settles legal disputes among the countries within the EU.
